The '''Blue Jerry Talisman''' is a {{Rare}} [[Accessory]] which can be crafted with 5 [[Green Jerry Talisman|Green Jerry Talismans]]. It grants the user -2 {{Stat|int}}. It can be upgraded to the [[Purple Jerry Talisman]] and can be further upgraded to the [[Golden Jerry Artifact]].

